# LeakSanitizer suppressions for fuzzing runs (LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=...).
# Needs llvm-symbolizer on PATH: suppressions match symbolized frames.
#
# libFuzzer's -fork parent leaks a small allocation in its own bookkeeping
# (LLVM 18), failing every fork-mode run at exit. Only the parent's frames
# match, so leaks in the fuzzed code (run in the child jobs) still report.
leak:fuzzer::FuzzWithFork
